WEBVTT

NOTE
Kind: captions
Source: Articulate Closed Captions Editor
Source Version: 3.103.35263.0

00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:00.939
This is Adam

00:00:01.639 --> 00:00:03.910
Adam has a rather large to do list today,

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.250
including completing a spreadsheet for work,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.510
answering some emails and finishing the assignment that is due next week.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.229
He has a very busy day,

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:14.310
yet distractions keep creeping in.

00:00:15.029 --> 00:00:17.549
Instead of working on the things he needs to get done,

00:00:17.799 --> 00:00:20.149
Adam chooses to watch a video on his laptop.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.350
He says it will only be this one video and then he will get back to work.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.360
But we know that isn't the case.

00:00:27.329 --> 00:00:30.209
Adam's phone is buzzing with notifications from

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.009
social media alerts to messages from friends.

00:00:33.569 --> 00:00:36.159
Constant notifications keep breaking his focus.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.840
His sister is in the next room playing music.

00:00:39.169 --> 00:00:41.720
His mum is downstairs talking loudly on the phone.

00:00:42.009 --> 00:00:44.400
Cars beep as they drive past his house.

00:00:44.569 --> 00:00:45.590
Fed up of the noise,

00:00:45.849 --> 00:00:49.200
Adam puts on some headphones and plays some relaxing music.

00:00:49.569 --> 00:00:52.009
He then sets up a visual timer on his phone to

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.889
make sure he can't access it for the next 25 minutes.

00:00:56.069 --> 00:00:58.779
he feels himself gaining control of the situation.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:02.200
Adam has now been working successfully for a little while.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:03.700
his spreadsheet is done,

00:01:03.909 --> 00:01:05.169
the emails are answered,

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:07.379
and now he is working on his assignment.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:08.870
With the right tools,

00:01:08.949 --> 00:01:10.410
Focus returns.

00:01:10.629 --> 00:01:12.470
Thanks to time management techniques,

00:01:12.629 --> 00:01:16.389
Adam has ended his day feeling happy and can go to bed with a clear mind.

